 Connection Version 5 Celebrity","ru":"Tamagotchi Connection Version 5 Celebrity","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"tamagotchi-school-toy-f0c8d5","title":"Tamagotchi School (toy)","ru":"Tamagotchi School (toy)","kind":"device","note":""}]}